{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets"]]},"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord","doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetKind"],"title":"Finding records","anchor":"Finding-records","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every record of one kind, across every image the program has loaded, and the values they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"produce."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/init(kind:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/kind","doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/records","doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/values"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSet"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records are declared at compile time as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@used"},{"type":"text","text":" globals in the section LinkerSets owns. In a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Mach-O image that is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"__DATA_CONST,__linker_sets"},{"type":"text","text":", each record a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord\/Literal"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In an ELF image it is the note section "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".note.linker_sets"},{"type":"text","text":", each record wrapped in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord\/Note"},{"type":"text","text":". A linker set finds them at run time in every image the loader has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mapped: the program, the shared libraries it was linked with, and any loaded later with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dlopen"},{"type":"text","text":". On Apple platforms it reads each image’s section through the loader’s list of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"images; on ELF platforms (Linux, Android, FreeBSD) it reads each image’s note segments"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dl_iterate_phdr"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let routes = LinkerSet<Route>(kind: .routes).values"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each read asks the loader again, so a read after a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dlopen"},{"type":"text","text":" includes the new image’s records."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Records come back image by image in the loader’s order, and within an image in the order the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linker laid them out, so two reads with no load between them return the same records in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A kind no record was declared with gives an empty set, as does kind 0, which marks an empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slot."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records survive dead stripping ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-dead_strip"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--gc-sections"},{"type":"text","text":") in debug and release builds:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@used"},{"type":"text","text":", and the section is retained. A record reaches the program only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linker links its module’s object file, though. SwiftPM links every object of a target’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dependencies, and so does Bazel’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift_library"},{"type":"text","text":", which is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alwayslink"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. A build"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that links a static archive’s members only on demand drops a module that nothing references"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by name. Link such a module whole ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-force_load"},{"type":"text","text":" on Mach-O, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--whole-archive"},{"type":"text","text":" on ELF)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reading never traps. A record whose reserved fields aren’t zero, written by a newer layout, is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skipped; a section whose size isn’t a whole number of records is read up to its last whole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record; on ELF, a note that isn’t LinkerSets’, or whose record size this version doesn’t know,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is skipped."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkerset"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LinkerSet","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/LinkerSets\/blob\/main\/Sources\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet.swift#L36","fileName":"LinkerSet.swift"},"externalID":"s:10LinkerSets0A3SetV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSet"}],"modules":[{"name":"LinkerSets"}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"LinkerSet"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSet/kind":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kind","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LinkerSetKind","preciseIdentifier":"s:10LinkerSets0A7SetKindV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/kind","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkerset\/kind","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The kind of record this set holds."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"kind","type":"topic"},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSet":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSet"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSet"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkerset","abstract":[{"text":"Every record of one kind, across every image the program has loaded, and the values they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"produce.","type":"text"}],"title":"LinkerSet","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet"},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSetRecord/isSupportedVersion":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkersetrecord\/issupportedversion","title":"isSupportedVersion","identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord\/isSupportedVersion","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSupportedVersion"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this version of LinkerSets can read the record: its reserved fields are zero, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every record of the current layout’s are."}]},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSetRecord":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSetRecord"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinkerSetRecord"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkersetrecord","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One entry in a linker set: a record an attached macro places in the section LinkerSets owns."}],"title":"LinkerSetRecord","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetRecord"},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSet/values":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"values"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/values","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkerset\/values","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of each record that produces a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"type":"text","text":", in the order of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet\/records","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"values","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://LinkerSets/documentation/LinkerSets/LinkerSetRecord/Note":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/linkersets\/linkerset